{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Team Up, Don\u2019t Break!</strong><br>Linkies is a multiplayer platformer made for teamwork.<br>Your success depends on how well you stay connected!<br>The closer you are, the faster and higher you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Chaotic Courses</strong> <br>Race through modular, futuristic maps as a team. <br>Simple controls, plenty of chaos! <br>Every jump, every step demands coordination \u2014 <br>if one panics, everyone falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Connection Power = Winning Power</strong> <br>Linkies redefines co-op platforming with its connection mechanic. <br>Stay close to grow stronger, drift apart and weaken. <br>It\u2019s more than a race \u2014 it\u2019s a test of your bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Voice Chat &amp; True Co-op Experience</strong> <br>Built for full co-op play. <br>Talk strategy or just laugh (and scream) together! <br>Your connection will be tested \u2014 both in-game and in friendship.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063950?t=1762454675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063950?t=1762454675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/01f1825b47c10de3feccaba9b1be87b66e5ed4a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762454675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/01f1825b47c10de3feccaba9b1be87b66e5ed4a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762454675","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"de